It additionally inlines a small number of icon path definitions derived from
Google's Material Design icons, which are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

The following icons in src/popup/icons.tsx have their SVG path data taken
from the upstream Material Design icon set and re-expressed as inline TSX
`<path>` elements:

  - EditIcon
  - VisibilityIcon
  - VisibilityOffIcon
  - SettingsIcon
  - CloseIcon

